<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0331_R05R0202_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t be scared. I ain’t a bad person.\rA place like this attract MEAN people.\rThey cause trouble eventually...\rThat’s why Uncle Rage watchin’.\nI’m Uncle Rage. That’s my name.\rThe echo down here...\nis CRAZY... CRAZY... CRAZY...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0331_R05R0202_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t be scared. I ain’t a bad person.\rA place like this attract MEAN people.\rThey cause trouble eventually...\rIt make me MAD just thinkin’ about\nit... My blood pressure...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0331_R05R0202_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AHA! That’s a RageCandyBar!\rCan I have it? PLEASE! I’ll be calm!\nI PROMISE I’ll be calm! {YESNO 0}\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0331_R05R0202_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} gave the RageCandyBar\nto the guy at the Underground Path.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0331_R05R0202_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">*munch*!\rHow UPSETTIN’!\rBut this SO GOOD!\r*munch munch*!\rAARGH! Make me MAD!\r*munch munch*!\rAargh...\r..................Phew!\rI feel WAY better. Sugar is therapy.\fGood looks! Take this!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0331_R05R0202_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TM64 is......\rtick-\n    tock\ftick-\f    tock\ftick-\f    tock\ftick-\f    tock\ftick...\f..................\f..................\r</language>
