	<row id="msg_0331_R05R0202_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A place like this attract MEAN people.\rThey cause trouble eventually...\rThat’s why Uncle Rage watchin’.\nAlways. From the shadows. Angrily.\rThe echo down here...\nis CRAZY... CRAZY... CRAZY...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0331_R05R0202_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gon’ eat it all by YOURSELF?!\nThat’s SELFISH! That make me MAD!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0331_R05R0202_00009" index="9">
